  "content_html": "<div class=\"entry-content close\">\n    <p>「趣味快問快答」活動完整告一段落囉！感謝好朋友們的大力參與，更重要的是今天得獎名單出爐囉～</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>趣味快問快答 (Facebook)</strong></p>\n<table width=\"38\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\">\n<table width=\"117\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ggyy9487\">張書漢</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WeiYiDreamer\">Wei-Yi Li </a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100004310049563\">陳有成</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/peter821231\">施正澎 </a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100000155407513\">林雨樺 </a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/charles610\">Cheng-Ting Sheu</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100002253811328\">黃柏諺</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/akong77\">吳汝剛</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/leoluo0727\">羅紹齊</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/brad.wei\">Brad Wei </a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100000216471588\">楊志彬</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tsolin.chen\">TsoLin Chen</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hc.chen.999\">Hc Chen</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CryoArcher\">Jerry Tsai</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100000004527722\">劉家杏</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"117\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>恭喜在 Facebook 上的獲奬者，請獲奬者在<strong>下週一 (4/15) 下午 5 時</strong>前寄私信給粉絲團小編，註明您的真實姓名、地址以及 Email。再次恭喜所有得獎的狐友們！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>趣味快問快答 (Google+)</strong></p>\n<table width=\"92\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/107542996865289030061\">黃信嘉</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/113278510860883912730\">Vantis Chen</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/111658517239978869786\">Isaac Huang</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/112157265398267312075\">許勝淳</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/104313569129492379357\">Jack Wu</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/105448370290184526354\">柳詠淵</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/105081747512330162071\">Asher Low</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/106251057754277493087\">Mark Yang</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/107361021204328687051\">Danyuan Wu</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/114375468442626772824\">Watson Tsai</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/107616069933309085938\">炵枋歆漾</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/104190649892534528787\">林瑋倫</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/105027456060054064561\">weking wang</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/116063281552828176001\">王乃昕</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"92\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/b/114653167240123163859/115311834175713785334\">Li Hong-Jhe</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>恭喜 Google+ 上的獲奬者，請獲奬者在<strong>下週一 (4/15) 下午 5 時</strong>前寄 Email 給主辦單位，註明您的真實姓名、地址以及 Email 至 tw-mktg@mozilla.com。再次恭喜所有得獎的狐友們！</p>\n<p>Firefox 珍藏卡貼套組：</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/pic222.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter  wp-image-2329\" title=\"pic222\" src=\"http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/pic222-1024x764.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"543\" height=\"404\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n      </div>",
  "content_text": "「趣味快問快答」活動完整告一段落囉！感謝好朋友們的大力參與，更重要的是今天得獎名單出爐囉～ 趣味快問快答 (Facebook) 張書漢 Wei-Yi Li 陳有成 施正澎 林雨樺 Cheng-Ting Sheu 黃柏諺 吳汝剛 羅紹齊 Brad Wei 楊志彬 TsoLin Chen Hc Chen Jerry Tsai 劉家杏 恭喜在 Facebook 上的獲奬者，請獲奬者在 下週一 (4/15) 下午 5 時 前寄私信給粉絲團小編，註明您的真實姓名、地址以及 Email。再次恭喜所有得獎的狐友們！ 趣味快問快答 (Google+) 黃信嘉 Vantis Chen Isaac Huang 許勝淳 Jack Wu 柳詠淵 Asher Low Mark Yang Danyuan Wu Watson Tsai 炵枋歆漾 林瑋倫 weking wang 王乃昕 Li Hong-Jhe 恭喜 Google+ 上的獲奬者，請獲奬者在 下週一 (4/15) 下午 5 時 前寄 Email 給主辦單位，註明您的真實姓名、地址以及 Email 至 tw-mktg@mozilla.com。再次恭喜所有得獎的狐友們！ Firefox 珍藏卡貼套組：",
